OL,3,GEast                                   
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMostly       
OL,6,Fcloudy overnight, although a few clear 
OL,7,Fspells are likely to develop.          
OL,8,FRemaining dry, with a strong easterly  
OL,9,Fwind near the coast. Becoming cold,    
OL,10,Fwith a frost possible by dawn.         
OL,12,CThursday:FA mix of sunny spells and    
OL,13,Fcloudier periods throughout Thursday,  
OL,14,Fwith conditions remaining dry. Breezy  
OL,15,Falong the coast. Feeling cool, with    
OL,16,Fovernight temperatures falling into    
OL,17,Fsingle figures.                        
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
