OL,3,GEast                                   
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FDry for  
OL,6,Fmost of Friday but patchy rain         
OL,7,Farriving in the west by the evening.   
OL,8,FFurther outbreaks of rain on Saturday, 
OL,9,Fheavier by the evening. Dry by Sunday, 
OL,10,Fwith sunshine.                         
